{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03054",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.95,
      "end_seconds": 5.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "Morning, uh, doctor. Lovely to meet you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.69,
      "end_seconds": 11.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 13.22,
      "end_seconds": 20.55,
      "duration_seconds": 7.33,
      "text": "Actually, you know, good afternoon, doctor. I look after them so I thought I'd come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.99,
      "end_seconds": 25.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "please do. Extra information is always welcome"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.72,
      "end_seconds": 39.13,
      "duration_seconds": 13.41,
      "text": "it's pain in my breastbone wound. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone. My neighbour said I should get it looked at"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.23,
      "end_seconds": 46.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.63,
      "end_seconds": 58.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.51,
      "end_seconds": 85.52,
      "duration_seconds": 11.01,
      "text": "okay: temp 36.8 degrees, saturation 97 percent, heart rate 83. And BP is 124 over 81. Okay, what's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.72,
      "end_seconds": 90.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "ah, uh, it's been ten days now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.25,
      "end_seconds": 97.77,
      "duration_seconds": 6.52,
      "text": "Mm, okay. Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.33,
      "end_seconds": 106.28,
      "duration_seconds": 7.95,
      "text": "It happens on and off. It's severe, honestly. I notice it more with coughing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.56,
      "end_seconds": 109.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.63,
      "end_seconds": 122.46,
      "duration_seconds": 11.83,
      "text": "It usually comes with a clicking in the breastbone. Erm, the clicking in the breastbone? That's been for four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.29,
      "end_seconds": 127.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "have you had any chest pain on exertion?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.69,
      "end_seconds": 134.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.64,
      "text": "Erm, uh, not at all, no chest pain on exertion."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.29,
      "end_seconds": 138.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Any fever or breathlessness at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.6,
      "end_seconds": 145.86,
      "duration_seconds": 5.26,
      "text": "Okay, uh, so no, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.44,
      "end_seconds": 150.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.25,
      "end_seconds": 154.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.9,
      "end_seconds": 169.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.18,
      "end_seconds": 178.3,
      "duration_seconds": 8.12,
      "text": "Let me think, you know, I've had heart disease for nearly five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.1,
      "end_seconds": 182.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.14,
      "end_seconds": 197.46,
      "duration_seconds": 14.32,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours. No, I share a house with my brother. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.24,
      "end_seconds": 203.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "okay, are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 204.64,
      "end_seconds": 208.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Erm, it's metoprolol, twice a day, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.58,
      "end_seconds": 211.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Do you know the the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 213.11,
      "end_seconds": 214.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "It's 50 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.11,
      "end_seconds": 218.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.0,
      "end_seconds": 222.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.47,
      "end_seconds": 241.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Did you ever have any procedures done?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.8,
      "end_seconds": 247.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Just a bunion operation, six years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.03,
      "end_seconds": 254.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.9,
      "end_seconds": 257.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.81,
      "end_seconds": 280.15,
      "duration_seconds": 8.34,
      "text": "the chest wound has healed, the breastbone is stable, and the vein-harvest wound on the leg is a little swollen"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.48,
      "end_seconds": 284.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "All finished, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.45,
      "end_seconds": 307.54,
      "duration_seconds": 13.09,
      "text": "so where does that leave us? I'm honestly not certain yet it could be recovering well after bypass surgery, or it might be a leg wound infection"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.46,
      "end_seconds": 313.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "So, do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.73,
      "end_seconds": 336.23,
      "duration_seconds": 20.5,
      "text": "I understand the worry at the moment I'd say it's recovering well after bypass surgery, and we'll watch how it goes the cardiac rehabilitation team would be the right next step, I'll refer you see me again in six weeks that's all from me any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 336.87,
      "end_seconds": 340.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "no, that's all. Thanks a lot"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 341.74,
      "end_seconds": 343.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}